title: "smart-contract-gnn-model: a dual-graph GNN pipeline for smart-contract vulnerability detection"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that detects five DASP vulnerability classes in Ethereum
  smart contracts from dual abstract-syntax-tree and control-flow graph
  representations, with typed data-flow enrichment, post-hoc line-level attribution,
  and a deployed web dashboard. The repository also contains the weak-supervision
  labelling campaign over four analysis tools, the coverage and corroboration
  diagnostics, and the learned-baseline suite used in the accompanying papers.
